			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">One of the funniest things I ever did was back in the days when MIM was first attempting to kill the emperor in SSRA.   Kattara, a friend of mine, was MIM's main raid leader.   MiM was raiding SSRA and Kat sent me a tell that she was having a bad day and people on her raid were acting stupid.  I was powerleveling alts and thought I would help her cheer up so I told cotw guildchat (about 40+ peeps) that Kattara was having a bad day and would everyone please send her a tell that she's sexy.   
<br />

<br />
You wonderful wolves did just that.  We all sent Kattara a bunch of 'sexy tells', some of us multiple times, on multiple accounts.
<br />

<br />
I expected Kat to send me a 'haha' back in tells after that but instead about 2 minutes later I got a 'WTF your guild wiped our raid'.
<br />

<br />
Apparently right as emperor was pulled Kattara's screen was spammed with 'love you' and 'you're sexy tells'.
<br />

<br />
Later when she calmed down, she told me that the timing on when those tells was perfect if we were trying to wreck MIM's raid.
<br />

<br />

